":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"I was able to create a sequence successfully.\r\nHowever, I have not been able to list it in the catalog. This may be related to other catalog synchronization issues that are already known, so sorry if this is a repeat.\r\n\r\nHere is a copy of what I did and the output received:\r\n```\r\npostgres=# \\c pbl_play\r\nYou are now connected to database \"pbl_play\" as user \"postgres\".\r\npbl_play=# select * from information_schema.sequences;\r\nselect * from information_schema.sequences;\r\nERROR:  Network error: GetTableLocations(pbl_play.pg_depend, , 1) failed: recvmsg error: Connection reset by peer (error 104)\r\n```\r\nIf I restart the cluster everything appears to be okay. So I tried again and this is the result I received:\r\n```\r\npbl_play=# select * from information_schema.sequences;\r\nselect * from information_schema.sequences;\r\nERROR:  Timed out: Read(tablet: 00000000000000000000000000000000, num_ops: 1, num_attempts: 343, txn: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000) passed its deadline 908.109s (passed: 59.998s): Network error (yb/util/net/socket.cc:590): recvmsg error: Connection reset by peer (error 104)\r\npbl_play=# \r\n```\r\nWhich appears to be a timeout, possibly related to the first problem locking a resource that is no longer available.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1666/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1666/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]